  "purpose": "Eight-slide timed model-edit diagnostic for add/remove/reorder/reparent/movement/size/color, bounded Stat corrections, interruption bursts, navigation crossfades and equal-group build authoring. Source build attributes do not establish audience reveal visibility; controlled browser coverage is specified separately in docs/quality/MOTION.md.",
